#
# What this repository is FOR: the tools and the documentation.
#
#     ICE-CUBE/ICE-CUBE-TOOLS\    the code
#     ICE-CUBE/ICE-CUBE-DOCS\     how it works and how to run it
#
# Everything excluded below is either generated, or is somebody's photograph,
# or is tied to this machine. Together they are ~780 MB of the ~784 MB here.
#
# ===========================================================================


# --- the automation browser -------------------------------------------------
# ~713 MB of Chrome profile. Machine-specific, rewritten on every run, and
# impossible to diff. It is the BROWSER's data, not this project's - which is
# why it lives beside the workspace rather than inside it.
BROWSER-AUTOMATION/


# --- the month folder -------------------------------------------------------
# ICE-CUBE-SEPT\ is the WORK, not the source: the BA photo folders, the flat
# NOTA copies, and the pipeline's own state.
#
#   .ledger.json          which cells are already inserted
#   _scan-state.json      how far each chat has been checked
#   _verified.json        what each cell was seen to contain
#   _manual-dates.json    dates read by hand or by the agent
#   _not-reports.json     images settled as "not a report"
#   captions.json         nominal + outlet read from captions
#   logs\                 pipeline logs
#   verify-shots\         the screenshots behind each verdict
#   <BA folder>\          the photos themselves
#
# Two reasons to keep all of it out. It changes on every run, so it would be
# noise in every diff. And the photos carry other people's names, addresses and
# receipts - they are not something to put in a repository by accident.
#
# The shape of this folder is documented in ICE-CUBE-DOCS\REFERENCE.md, so
# nothing is lost by not tracking it.
ICE-CUBE/ICE-CUBE-SEPT/


# --- staging ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Images pulled from WhatsApp, rebuilt by every fetch. Safe to delete at any
# time; there is nothing here that is not produced again on the next run.
ICE-CUBE/WA-DOWNLOAD/


# --- machine and tool clutter -----------------------------------------------
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
*~

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
node_modules/

